  "body": "At the moment this returns `Dict[str, Any]`. I'd rather this be `Dict[str, object]` so that we can't just assume the shape of the body is as we expect.\r\n\r\nTo make that kind of change we'd need to have some way to fetch, deserialise and validate a request body which returns a meaningful type. My vote for doing so is another function which takes a Pydantic model.",
